<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48065" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">textus</span></b> , ūs, m.
		texo, I. B., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>texture</i>, <i>tissue</i>, <i>structure</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in
			post - Aug. prose). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">haec sunt tenuia textu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lucr.
					4, 728</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capiuntur purpurae parvulis rarique textu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 37, 61, § 132</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">18, 7, 10,
				§ 60</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, of language, <i>construction</i>, <i>combination</i>, <i>connection</i>, <i>context</i>, <i><span class="en">Quint. 9,
				4, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">8, 6,
			57</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rem brevi textu percurram,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 15, 7, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ut ostendit textus superior,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 15, 8, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quod contra foederum textum juvarentur
					Armeniae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 27, 12, 18</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gestorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 27, 12, 11</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Manil. 3, 270</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
